Step 10: Deploy DEV
helm install productapi-dev ./k8s/helm -f ./k8s/helm/values-dev.yaml
Step 11: Deploy UAT
helm install productapi-uat ./k8s/helm -f ./k8s/helm/values-uat.yaml
Step 12: Deploy PROD
helm install productapi-prod ./k8s/helm -f ./k8s/helm/values-prod.yaml
Harness Integration

This is likely what you remember.

Harness has an environment variable:

ENVIRONMENT=dev

or

ENVIRONMENT=uat

or

ENVIRONMENT=prod

Then Harness executes:

helm upgrade --install productapi \
  ./k8s/helm \
  -f ./k8s/helm/values-${ENVIRONMENT}.yaml

Examples:

helm upgrade --install productapi ./k8s/helm -f values-dev.yaml
helm upgrade --install productapi ./k8s/helm -f values-uat.yaml
helm upgrade --install productapi ./k8s/helm -f values-prod.yaml